roject (MRP)\n\n1. At beginning,  the code editor interface: English input functions normally\n2. Switch to Chinese input method\n3. Attempt to input Chinese characters\n4. After this, no further input operations are possible, even if you switch back to the English input method","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114549/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}